  "description": "MOCNIF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H74 Er4 N18 O26. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.780-4.283 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.99-113.17°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Er4(C11H11N3O4)6(CH3OH)2. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
